# Business Requirements Document (BRD)

| **ID** | **Requirement** | **Priority** |
|---|---|---|
| BR-01 | Customer can log in to the portal using valid credentials | High |
| BR-02 | Customer can search and purchase products online | High |
| BR-03 | Customer can choose the product quantity and based on availability can purchase a product | High |
| BR-04 | Customer can provide name, delivery address and phone number during checkout | High |
| BR-05 | Customer can make online payments for purchases | High |
| BR-06 | Customer can view the order summary after purchase | High |
